Files under data/ are tracked and published with this repository.

demo_* files
  Generated by this project's CLI from the fictional inputs in examples/
  (commands: docs/VALIDATION.md). They are not experimental results.

smoke/pubchem_2244_20260917/
  Source: PubChem (National Center for Biotechnology Information, U.S.
  National Library of Medicine), PUG REST service, BioAssay AID 2244
  (deposited by Southern Research Specialized Biocontainment Screening
  Center, "WNV SAR1 Tox"; a cell-based cytotoxicity assay).
  Downloaded 2026-09-17 (UTC). Each *.receipt.json records the request URL,
  retrieval time and SHA256 of the unmodified response it sits next to:
  description.json, assay.csv, compounds_0000000.json. compounds.csv was
  written by `fragment_ft fetch-pubchem` from compounds_0000000.json.
  Kept only as an API/file-format smoke test; not curated, not training data.

  Reuse of these files is subject to the NCBI website and data usage
  policies: https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/home/about/policies/
  Check those policies and the assay record before reuse. This NOTICE adds
  no terms of its own, and the repository's code license does not relicense
  third-party data.
